  "implementation": "Reuse canonical NURBS import and normalized working frames. Caller-selected source intervals feed SMLib global curve minimum and curve maximum proposals. Independently globally reproject maximum candidates, native knot/span-midpoint/grid samples and local-peak solver candidates before ranking. Re-evaluate final witnesses on original sources and recover original parameters while retaining normalized NURBS fractions and direct line/polyline/NURBS parameter visits. Check nearest-pair membership in at least one direction for maxima and both directions for minima. Only within-tolerance minimum/maximum ordering roundoff selects a shared attained witness; inconsistent results reject. Keep the diagnostic endpoint projection policy separate from the distance producer.",
